  "title": "Cavite State University catalog",
  "text": "Cavite State University catalog Skip to main content Cavite State University Your cart is empty. Cart Lists Public lists Volunteerism GAD Related Manuscripts_2022-2024 GAD Related Manuscripts_202-2024 Gender Related Books Sustainable Development Goals Gender-Related Manuscripts Theses 2025 Print Books 2026 Online E-Books 2025 Online E-Books 2024 View all Your cookies Search history Search the catalog by: Library catalog Title Author Subject ISBN ISSN Series Call number Search the catalog by keyword Advanced search Authority search Library Home Koha home Quote of the day I am often amazed at how much more capability and enthusiasm for science there is among elementary school youngsters than among college students. ~ Carl Sagan History The two-storey University Library started its operation in June 1980, with a collection of 2,946 volumes (consisting of 1,196 titles) turned over from the old high school library. After the books were catalogued, the library finally opened its door to the users in November 1980. Since its opening, its collection has increased to 106,459 volumes (92,199 titles). It has acquired a total of 5,055 series titles (journals, newsletters, annual reports, newspapers, bulletins, popular magazines, etc.) The present University Library has been named Ladislao N. Diwa Memorial Library and Museum (LDMLM) since its launching on July 14, 1997, in recognition of the various contributions of Ladislao N. Diwa and his heirs to the library. #BringingTheLibraryToYou Online Library Services Request for CvSU THESIS Abstract Request for PRINT BOOK Pages Request for E-BOOK Password 📢 Bulletin Board NEW Print Books 2026 NEW Theses 2025 Print Books 2025 Online E-Books 2025 Theses 2024 Print Books 2024 Online E-Books 2024 Print Books 2023 Online E-Books 2023 Theses 2023 Print Books 2022 Online E-Books 2022 Theses 2022 Print Books 2021 Online E-Books 2021 Online Library Brochures #Bringing the Library to You 😊 Copyright © 2026. Cavite State University | Koha 24.11.12",
